@wearables-ui-toolkit/androidx-shapes

This product includes software developed as part of the Android Open Source
Project (https://source.android.com/):

  AndroidX graphics-shapes (androidx.graphics.shapes)
  Copyright 2022 The Android Open Source Project
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This package is a TypeScript port of that software. Modifications — including
translation from Kotlin to TypeScript, JavaScript data-model adaptation, API
surface reduction, and SVG path serialization — were made by Meta Platforms,
Inc. and are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The derived source files are:

  src/AndroidXShapes.ts
  src/AndroidXShapes.types.ts

See UPSTREAM.md for the upstream source location and a detailed description of
the port.
